Dear Roger,

Here are the final 18-page interim report (LHT-20260827-GRT-001 v1.0) and the=
 separate chapter sheet. The sheet gives the source behind each of the six ju=
dgements we made yesterday. Chapters 1=E2=80=934 are complete manuscripts and=
 Chapters 5 and 6 remain in progress.

I will first check the four Box 14 leaves with Susan and look for the committ=
ee's own record of the decision by 30 September. Once I have settled what the=
 correspondence can support, I will fix the scope of Chapter 6 by 30 October.=
 The chapter keeps access to the earlier wording and consideration of its cla=
uses as separate questions. That leaves November for the whole-book read and =
moves the planned publication from October 2026 to January 2027.

Could you read both files before the report goes to the Henderson Humanities =
Fund? In particular, I would be grateful if you could check that the order of=
 the two outstanding jobs and the date that follows from it are clear. France=
s's figures are in the expenditure section.

Many thanks,
Judith

